{
  "name": "locust",
  "_about": "A locust -- the desert locust (Schistocerca gregaria), 5.5 cm long: the swarming grasshopper; long-bodied, the pronotum a saddle with a keel, short antennae, striped eyes; the tegmina long, reaching well past the abdomen and the hind knees, pale and spotted brown; the hind legs long and powerful, the tibia spined. A swarming adult is bright yellow. Coats: the young pink adult of the swarm, the solitary sandy-grey phase. Written whole by tools/creaturegen/rework/winged/others.py on insectlib.py + wlib.py (jointed legs on a walking gait, antennae that wave; the wings at rest as the animal holds them, beating in the variant \"flying\").",
